have set a MASQUERADE rule to my private network. I am able to use FTP,
HTTP etc successfully to hosts outside the firewall but not TFTP. I am
able to replace a Windows 2000 RRAS NAT server instead of the linux
firewall and that works fine. Is there a problem with MASQUERADE and
tftp?
